// Suspicious Set Value of MSDT in Registry (CVE-2022-30190) | T1221 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules-emerging-threats/2022/Exploits/CVE-2022-30190/registry_set_exploit_cve_2022_30190_msdt_follina.yml
TargetObject:HKCR\\ms\-msdt\\*

// Stellar Cyber Query Builder (DSL):
{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        {
          "query_string": {
            "query": "TargetObject:HKCR\\\\ms\\-msdt\\\\*",
            "analyze_wildcard": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
